# Does Forge open Condescend's two asks (bob's own
# "pay {X} or be countered" confirm, and alice's unconditional Scry 2) AT
# ONCE, or in sequence? Bob (`ai…` keys) casts Grizzly Bears in his own Main
# Phase 1; alice (`human…` keys) responds with Condescend, X=1, targeting
# it. Bob keeps one Forest spare after paying Grizzly Bears' {1}{G} (three
# Forests total) so Forge's own "pay or decline" choice is a REAL one, not
# skipped for lack of mana.
